#: guidedog.py:555
msgid "About"
msgstr "O programu"

#: guidedog.py:741
msgid ""
"An error occurred while writing the script to disk.\n"
"\n"
"(Detailed message: \"%1\")"
msgstr ""
"Greška uspostavljena tokom pisanja skripte na disk.\n"
"\n"
"(Detaljna poruka: \"%1\")"

#: guidedog.py:755
msgid ""
"The system's routing configuration has been modified.\n"
"\n"
"Shall I restore it to the previous configuration?\n"
"\n"
"These changes may disrupt current network connections."
msgstr ""
"Sistemska rutinska konfiguracija je promjenjena.\n"
"\n"
"Da li ih treba vratiti na prethodnu konfiguraciju?\n"
"\n"
"Ove promjene mogu poremetiti trenutnu internet konekciju."

#: guidedog.py:820
msgid "Import Configuration"
msgstr "Uvezi podešavanja"

#: guidedog.py:829
msgid ""
"Guidedog was unable to read the file at %1 as being a Guidedog script.\n"
"This probably means that this file in not actually a Guidedog script.\n"
"\n"
"(Detailed message \"%2\")"
msgstr ""
"Guidedog nije bio u mogućnosti da pročita datoteku na %1 kao Guidedog "
"skriptu.\n"
"Ovo vjerovatno znači da ta datoteka ustvari nije Guidedog skripta.\n"
"\n"
"(Detaljna poruka \"%2\")"

#: guidedog.py:831
msgid "Error during import"
msgstr "Greška prilikom uvoza"

#: guidedog.py:843
msgid "Export Configuration"
msgstr "Izvozna podešavanja"

#: guidedog.py:850
msgid ""
"An error occurred while writing the script to %1.\n"
"\n"
"(Detailed message: \"%2\")"
msgstr ""
"Greška se pojavila tokom pisanja skripte na %1.\n"
"\n"
"(Detaljna poruka: \"%2\")"

#: guidedog.py:1041
msgid ""
"You are about to modify the system's routing configuration.\n"
"These changes may disrupt current network connections.\n"
"\n"
"Do you wish to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Upravo trebate promijeniti sistemske uobičajne konfiguracije.\n"
"Ove promjene mogu poremetiti trenutne mrežne konekcije.\n"
"\n"
"Da li želite nastaviti?"

#: guidedog.py:1062
msgid ""
"An error occurred while modifying the routing configuration.\n"
"The operating system has this to report about the error: %1"
msgstr ""
"Greška uspostavljena prilikom promjene uobičajne konfiguracije.\n"
"Operativni sistem ima ovaj izvještaj oko greške: %1"

#: guidedog.py:1067
msgid "Modify Routing Configuration"
msgstr "Promijeni usmjeravačka podeševanja"

#: guidedog.py:1068
msgid ""
"Configuring...\n"
"\n"
"Output:"
msgstr ""
"Podešavam...\n"
"\n"
"Izlaz:"

#: guidedog.py:1080
msgid ""
"You are about to reset the system's routing configuration.\n"
"These changes may also disrupt current network connections.\n"
"\n"
"Do you wish to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Upravo hoćete da restartujete sistemske usmjerivačke konfiguracije.\n"
"Ove promjene mogu naškoditi trenutnim mrežnim povezivanjima.\n"
"\n"
"Želite nastaviti?"

#: guidedog.py:1096
msgid "Resetting system configuration"
msgstr "Restartujem sistemska podešavanja"

#: guidedog.py:1097
msgid ""
"Resetting system configuration...\n"
"\n"
"Output:"
msgstr ""
"Restartujem sistemska podešavanja...\n"
"\n"
"Izlaz:"

#: guidedog.py:1122
msgid ""
"Guidedog was unable to find a Guidedog script at %1.\n"
"This is probably ok, it just means that this is the first time Guidedog has "
"been run on this system.\n"
"But please be aware that the settings shown may not represent the system's "
"current routing configuration.\n"
"Your Guidedog settings will take effect once you use the 'Apply' button or "
"exit Guidedog using 'Ok'."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog nije u mogućnosti da nađe Guidedog skriptu na %1.\n"
"Ovo je ok, samo znači da je prvi put Guidedog pokrenut na ovom sistemu.\n"
"Ali budite upozoreni da postavke prikazane ne predstavljaju trenutne "
"usmjerivačke konfiguracije.\n"
"Vaša Guidedog podešavanja će imati uticaj tek nakon pritiska na 'Primjeni' "
"dugme ili izađite iz Guidedog koristeći 'Ok'."

#: guidedog.py:1133
msgid ""
"Guidedog was unable to read the file at %1 as being a Guidedog script.\n"
"Please be aware that the settings shown may not represent the system's "
"current routing configuration.\n"
"\n"
"(Detailed message \"%2\")"
msgstr ""
"Guidedog nije u mogućnosti da pročita datoteku na %1 kao Guidedog skriptu.\n"
"Budite svjestni da postavke prikazane ne predstavljaju trenutne usmjerivačke "
"konfiguracije.\n"
"\n"
"(Detaljna poruka \"%2\")"

#: guidedog.py:1144
msgid "Guidedog"
msgstr "Guidedog"

#: guidedog.py:1148
msgid "(c) 2001-2008 Simon Edwards"
msgstr "(c) 2001-2008 Simon Edwards"

#: guidedog.py:1149
msgid "Utility for easily configuring advanced networking features."
msgstr "Alatke za lako postavljanje naprednih mrežnih dodataka."

#: guidedog.py:1163
msgid ""
"Since you do not have superuser privilages, Guidedog is running with reduced "
"functionality. Scripts may be Imported/Exported, but  the system's "
"networking settings may not be changed."
msgstr ""
"Kako nemate superkorisničke priviligije, Guidedog se izvršava sa smanjenom "
"funkcionalnošću. Skripte će biti uvezene/izvezene, ali mrežne postavke "
"sistema neće biti promjenjene."

